<element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>20</x><y>1010</y><w>1545</w><h>142</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>Alternative flows
- Missing/invalid fields: user is asked to correct them.
- Email or phone already exists: user is told to log in to the existing account.
- Wrong password: login denied, no code sent.
- Wrong code: retry; after 3 failures the proxy locks the user out temporarily.
- Code expired: user requests a new code.
- EmailSMSService unavailable: user is told the code could not be sent.</panel_attributes><additional_attributes/></element>
